# Diagnosis — V2i drives time out on real Claude in Docker

- date: 2026-09-27
- branch: fix/cli-254-v2i-theme-picker-seed
- diagnosed_via: Path C probe + PR #269 characterization + Path B v1 falsification
- v1_hypothesis: seeding /home/adopter/.claude/settings.json with {"theme":"dark"}
- v1_result: FALSIFIED — CI run 36333931759, exit 31, drives burned full 90s
- v1_source_of_error: settings.json is the wrong file for onboarding state
- v2_hypothesis: seed /home/adopter/.claude.json (root of HOME) with
  hasCompletedOnboarding + theme + projects.<cwd>.hasTrustDialogAccepted

## Step 0 — Reproduce
- Command: docker-smoke workflow run against v1.9.4
- Observed: 3 drives (/onboard-repo, /launch, /riff) exit 11
  → mapped to 31 (EXIT_INTERACTIVE_TIMEOUT) by entry.sh V2i wrapper.
- Log: harness-out/interactive-2026-09-27T14-03-59Z/interactive/drive.log
- Repro: every drive, every V2i run.

## Step 1 — Is / Is Not
- IS: Real Claude in Docker, freshly launched, first-run.
- IS NOT: fake_claude.sh fixture (drives PASS against fixture per PR #260).
- IS NOT: `claude -p` non-interactive mode.
- Works: `claude -p "hello"` in same container.

## Step 2 — Five Whys
1. Why do drives exit 11? expect timeout waits 90s for READY>; never appears.
2. Why does READY> never appear? Claude never reaches REPL — blocks on prior UI.
3. What does Claude show? "Welcome to Claude Code v2.1.197" then
   "Choose a theme" picker (options 1-7).
4. Why the picker? First-run of claude with no onboarding-complete marker
   triggers it.
5. Where does Claude read the onboarding marker? Per code.claude.com/docs/
   en/settings-reference + anthropics/claude-code#4714: ~/.claude.json
   (root of HOME), NOT ~/.claude/settings.json. That was the v1 error.

## Step 3 — Revised Hypothesis (v2)
Pre-seeding /home/adopter/.claude.json (root of HOME) with:
  { hasCompletedOnboarding: true, theme: "dark",
    projects: { "/home/adopter/test": { hasTrustDialogAccepted: true } } }
skips onboarding + theme picker + per-project trust dialog. Real Claude
drops straight to REPL.

## v1 falsification test result
- Test: build modified image with settings.json seed; run V2i; read
  drive.log timing. If REPL prompt within 90s, confirmed.
- Result: CI run 36333931759 exit 31. Drive timing 91s + 90s + 90s.
  Every drive burned its full timeout. Hypothesis falsified.
- Cause of failure: seed file at wrong path. Claude does not read
  onboarding state from ~/.claude/settings.json.

## v2 falsification test (pending CI rerun)
Rerun docker-smoke against revised image. If drives exit 0 (or a
non-timeout code), v2 confirmed. If still exit 31, read drive.log
for the next gate.

## Alternative explanations (Peirce)
- Alt-A: Wrong config path — CONFIRMED. Fix: use ~/.claude.json.
- Alt-B: Missing companion fields — LIKELY CONFIRMED per docs. Fix:
  seed hasCompletedOnboarding + theme + projects entry.
- Alt-C: Picker fires whenever isatty — DISPROVEN by docs; the seed
  IS the skip mechanism when populated correctly.

